msgstr "Besedilo"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3407
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3407
msgid "Text Hover"
msgstr "Besedilo ob prehodu"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3432
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3432
msgid ""
"Configure navigation and control options that apply to all MetaSlider "
"galleries."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte možnosti navigacije in nadzora, ki se uporabljajo za vse "
"galerije MetaSlider."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3442
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3442
msgid "Show thumbnails"
msgstr "Prikaži sličice"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3443
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3443
msgid ""
"Display thumbnail images at the bottom of the gallery for easy navigation. "
"This is available for slideshows and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje sličice slik na dnu galerije za enostavno navigacijo. To je na "
"voljo za diaprojekcije in galerije slik."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3455
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3455
msgid "Show \"Open in Gallery\" button"
msgstr "Prikaži gumb \"Odpri v galeriji\""

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3456
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3456
msgid ""
"When enabled, shows a button to open the gallery. When disabled, clicking "
"the slide, image, or video directly opens the gallery."
msgstr ""
"Ko je omogočeno, prikaže gumb za odpiranje galerije. Ko je onemogočeno, "
"klik na diapozitiv, sliko ali video neposredno odpre galerijo."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3473
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3473
msgid "Show an icon instead of button"
msgstr "Prikaži ikono namesto gumba"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3474
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3474
msgid "When enabled, displays a small icon instead of the full button text."
msgstr "Ko je omogočeno, prikaže majhno ikono namesto celotnega besedila gumba."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3488
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3488
msgid "Show captions"
msgstr "Prikaži napise"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3489
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3489
msgid ""
"When enabled, display captions in the gallery window. This is available for "
"slideshows, images, and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Ko je omogočeno, prikaže napise v oknu galerije. To je na voljo za "
"diaprojekcije, slike in galerije slik."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3496
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3496
msgid "Advanced lightbox features are available through MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr "Napredne funkcije lightboxa so na voljo preko MetaSlider Gallery Pro."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3498
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3498
msgid "Get a preview of the advanced features available in MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr ""
"Pridobite predogled naprednih funkcij, ki so na voljo v MetaSlider Gallery "
"Pro."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3501
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3501
msgid ""
"These advanced LightGallery.js plugins are available in the Pro version "
"with additional customization options."
msgstr ""
"Ti napredni dodatki za LightGallery.js so na voljo v Pro različici z "
"dodatnimi možnostmi prilagoditve."

